<a href="text://<font color=#89D2E8><font color=#FFFF00>Help (aggdef)</font>

<font color=#FCA712>'aggdef' command</font>
    Find out where to set your aggdef slider to be 1/1
    <font color=#FFFFFF>!aggdef &lt;attack time&gt; &lt;recharge time&gt; &lt;init value&gt;</font>

If you are lazy, just use
    <font color=#FFFFFF>!weapon &lt;drop weapon into chat&gt;</font>

Example:
    Your weapon has an attack time of <font color=#FFFFFF>1.2</font> seconds and a recharge time of <font color=#FFFFFF>1.5</font> seconds.
    Your melee/ranged init is <font color=#FFFFFF>1200</font>:
    <a href='chatcmd:///tell Nadybot !aggdef 1.2 1.5 1200'>/tell Nadybot !aggdef 1.2 1.5 1200</a>

<i>See <a href='chatcmd:///tell Nadybot !help syntax'>!help syntax</a> for an explanation of the command syntax</i>">Help (aggdef)</a>
